<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timɔte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi É Teʋeni Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timɔte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Timɔte ná-sɛʋɛi velesiɛi ɠa é ga sɛʋɛi velesiɛi nii keelai Pɔle teʋeni ná-kaladopoi Timɔte ma. Sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛʋɛ Pɔle ná-eteai ɠaaɓela siɛgi zu. É ɠɛni kasoi ɠa Wɔlɔme naama ziɛgi zu. Pɔleni ta Timɔte ti wola ɠilini ʋa, siɛ mɔinmɔin su é ɓena naa loli vɔlɔ ga ná-doun zunui (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TI 1:2">1Ti 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 1:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:22">Fil 2:22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa sɛʋɛ naanigɔiti saama niiti Pɔle ti leʋega nu ɠilagilagiti ma, kɛlɛ é la teʋeni Egilisi ma. Zɔ saʋagɔiti ta ga: Timɔte ná-sɛʋɛ mɔungi ta Tite nɔnɔi, naa ʋɛɛ Filemɔn nɔnɔi ʋa. Timɔte ná-sɛʋɛi velesiɛi nii ɠɛɛ ziɛgi zu, wɔinzeɠemai ɠa é ɠɛni keletiɛinti polu Wɔlɔme masa zooi zu ná pɛ. Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ naama vai maaʋele ɠa é kɛɛni Pɔle ɠɛni la kasoi ɠa, ta é ɠɛni Timɔte iɲɔdɔɔzu la ga naa yiilɔɔ kpɔlɔiti bu. É ɠɛni Timɔte ma ɓalaa, yeeɠɛɠala ɓaaɓaagiti ta ʋaazu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:1">3:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pɔle tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga Timɔte luʋɔ fai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>), naa ʋoluma é naa iɲɔdɔɔ vai (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1:3-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma é Timɔte zasulɔɔni ga naa yiilɔɔ kpɔlɔi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. É zɛba kalagi tanigaa ve zea é ʋilɛ kiti vai tanigaa ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. É tooni ɠisu naa ʋolu é lo yeeɠɛɠalaiti ba ti ʋaazu, ta ʋelei a zoo ɓɔɠɔ zosu da naama ziɛgi zu ga pagɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-4:8">3:1—4:8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ ga fai tanigaa é zumɔgai, é lo Timɔte ɓɔɠɔi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4:9-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, gè ga Yesu Kilista ná-keelai, GALA ziimai maaʋele ma, nɛ̀i tèʋegai ga gè ɗa minazeɠe zɛnvui ma vai laazeeli, de sɔlɔɔsu da-ɠilibalai zu da Yesu Kilista, <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>nà è luʋɔsu, Timɔte, dòin è nɛai bɛ̀ gola. Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA ta de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ti zaalai la è ma, ti è maawɔinɠa, ti ziilɛigi ve è ʋɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mamagi ta iɲɔdɔɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Nà GALA mamasu, nii gè botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ kisiɛ ʋagɔi zu, eɠɛʋelei mɛ̀mɛwolani ti kɛɛni la bɛ, nà ɗa ɠisiɛ è zu yeenɔpɛ nà-GALA faliiti su, kpidi ʋɛɛ folo ʋa. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Nà ɗa ɠisiɛ è-ɠaazuɗɛi zu, wɔin ɠa mà gola ga gè è ʋɛtɛ, nii a kɛ zìimaʋɛ laave ga koozunɛɛi. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Kì ka ɗa-ɠidaaleʋei zu, nii wooveleda la su. È-lee Loyise ta è-leewola Enise ɠa naama ɠidaaleʋei ɠɛni ti ya è luɠɔ. Dàaʋɛ da ga zekana é è ya la ɓalaa. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà è loozu ɠisu, ga è GALA ná-vebɛanii niinɛ ʋolu, nii è sɔlɔɔni, siɛgi zu gè yeelaani la è ma. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Zɛnvui GALA ge feai de ya, é la de ɠɛɛzu ga ladalala nuiti, kɛlɛ ná-Zɛnvui ɠa zɛbɛi veezu de ʋɛ, ta nɛɛbɛi, naa ʋɛɛ ɠimalai ʋa.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Naa ɠa é ba, mina unfe ga zeele wooi wo fai Maliɠii ʋɛ. Mina unfe ɓalaa ga ze, nɛ̀i gè ga kasoɠa nui ná-faa zu. Kɛlɛ kɛni è ɗɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ kpɔlɔi zu Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi vaa zu, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge ma zɛbɛi veezu la è ya. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Tɔ ɠa é de ɠizogai, é de loli ga toli ɲadegai, naa maa la zɔlɔɔni ga kɛɛwotiiti maaʋele niiti de ti ɠɛɛni, kɛlɛ tɔɔzei é seini kpasu, é deve ɠana, ná-zaalai zu. É naama zaalai veeni de ʋɛ ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele, kaite aisa wɔlɔwɔlɔi. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Kɛlɛ zaalai naa ɠulaa kɛlɛma niizu de ʋɛ, ga de Ɠizo Nui Yesu Kilista ʋaa vai. É saai ná-zobogi ɠulaai zea, é zɛnvui ta saalalai ɠula kɛlɛma ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>GALA ge kàsɔɠiliʋɛ ga gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi naa laazeeli, gè ɠɛ ga keelai ta kalamɔin. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Naa ɠa é ga nà-kpɔlɔiti ma ungi. Kɛlɛ gè la unfesu ga naa, mazɔlɔɔ gè naa ɠwɛɛ, nii kìdaaleʋeai ma, dàaʋɛ da ga zobogi ɠa bɛ, nii é kalivaai mà, é naa makɛ eyɛsu tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Gaama ɓɔɛiti è ti mɛnigai dà, ziɛ ga tiye, kɛ kidaaleʋei ta nɛɛbɛi zu ti zɔlɔɔsu ni nu ɗa ɠilina Yesu Kilista ʋa. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Makɛ kala pagɔiti ma, ti ɠalivaai è ma ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai maaʋele, nii é zeini ade-yiimaʋɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>È suɠwɛɛ ga niiti pɛ ti Azi yooi zu, ti màaɠelesa teʋea, ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga Fizɛle ta Ɛlemozɛne. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Maliɠii ná-maawɔinɠai ɠɛ Wonezifɔle ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ é ɠɛni ìɲɔdɔɔzu yeeɠɛɠala mɔinmɔin su, é la ɠɛni unfeni ga nà-kasoɠa vai, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>tɔun siɛgi zu é ʋaani la Wɔlɔme, é gàiziɛni gola, eyɛsu é kà. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Maliɠii va bu, é GALA ná-maawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔ tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi. È suɠwɛɛ ga pagɔ, botii kpein é kɛɛni bɛ̀ Efɛze taazuʋɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilista ná-salaʋusu ʋagɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Ɗɔun ɗa, dòun, è-zɛbɛi ɠaiziɛ zaalai zu, de sɔlɔɔsu da-ɠilibalai zu, da Yesu Kilista. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Kalagi nii è sɔlɔɔgai zèa, gè ɗa bo zeele mɔinmɔin gaazu, ti ɠaliva wooɠɛɠila nuiti ma, niiti tiya ɓɔɠɔi ta zoo ti taɠiligaani kala da.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Va bu, è ɗɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ kpɔlɔi zu, eɠɛ Yesu Kilista ná-salaʋusu ʋagɔi. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Salaʋusu nɔpɛ ge la ná, nii a ɗa ɓɔɠɔ lɔ faa ɠiligiti su, ni toɠa pɔ ga é nɛɛ ná-kundiɠii ʋɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Ɠaɠo bo nu nɔpɛ ge la ná, a zoo zalai zɔlɔɔsu, ni é la ziɛni ga deveiti, ti zeiɗai. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Tii ɠɛ nui é botii ɓaaɓaagi ɠɛɛzu, maanɛɛʋɛ tɔ mɔunpa é nɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ma lɔnɔgi zu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Ɠida naa wu ga pagɔ, nii gè bosu è ma, naazu Maliɠii ɠa ti pɛ gaaɠaa ɠigi ve è ʋɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠizɛ Yesu zu nii é ɠulani saai ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Ɠigi yɛ Yesu Kilista zu, nii é ga Davide mavofodai, buzeɠeai é ɠula saai ya, eɠɛʋelei Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi bosu la, nii gè daazeelizu. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Naa ɠa gè kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔsu ma vaa zu, ti ɗa gìli eɠɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nu. Kɛlɛ GALA daawooi la ɠilini. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà yiilɔɔzu fai pɛ bu, naati ta-vaa zu, niiti GALA ge yiimazeɠeai ga tiye, naa ɠa a kɛ tiya ɓalaa ti kizogi ta ɠɔoɠɔ lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Wooi niiti ta ga lada ɓɔɛi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">«Ni ada zaa ʋɔɔma ada tɔun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">da zɛnvui wo tɔun ba.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Ni da lona kpaan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">da masadai ɠɛ ɓalaa tɔun ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Ni da ɠɛlɛna ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">tɔ ɓalaa ka ɠɛlɛ ade ʋa.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Ni da ɠɛna ga wooʋalada nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">tɔun ka yɛsu ga wooɠɛɠila nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">mazɔlɔɔ é la ɓɔɠɔ maaɠaalia tɔ ɓɔɠɔi.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gaama ɓɔɛi ɠaaɠwɛ ga pagɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Nuiti kitoo niima vaiti su, è ti maaɓakpa GALA gaazu, ti ɓeteʋe maaɠaali vaiti ba, ti la faa nɔpɛ paa nu ma, kɛni nɔ ti ti woomɛni nuiti ziiɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ɠaaɓa ga zɛbɛi pɛ, è ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga nui nii GALA ka yeezei bu, botiɠɛ nui nii nu la unfe faa nɔpɛ ka ba, nii é gaama wooi laazeelizu ga sɔledai. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Yeeɠula wafuun kpɔɛzuɠulaiti su, niiti ti la zolooni kidaaleʋei ma, mazɔlɔɔ zɔiti ti ʋilɛsu naati polu, naati ta ɗa li nɔ luɠɔma, GALA gaazuluabalalai zu. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Kalagi ti bosu, naa ɠa luula eɠɛ palai, su ɗa li ga wɔɔlɔa. Yimené ta Filɛteni ta ga naama nui ta. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Ti zeɠea gaamai ʋa, ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Kula saayai ɓega ga ɠɛ niina.» Ʋele ɠana ti nu mɔinmɔin kakasu la kidaaleʋe ʋelei ʋa. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, seɓasemai GALA ge daai, naa ɠa loni kpaan, niima wooiti sɛʋɛʋɛ ma ga poogi: «Maliɠii ná-nuiti kwɛɛ»,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">GlS 16:5</ref></char>.</char></note> ta «Zɔi nɔpɛ é bosu ga toɠa ga Maliɠii nɔnɔ, é maaɠooza telebotalai ʋa».<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Pɛlɛ wolai wu, zanu aniɲakai ta wali aniɲakai ɠila nɔ laade, é ʋa ɠɛ ná, gulu geleiti ta pɔlɔ geleiti ɓalaa ta ɗa ɠɛ ná. Tanigaani ta ɗa ɠɛ faa unbu yɛ, mɔtaiti botii ɗa ɠɛ naati su yeenɔpɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Ni deɠɛmu nu a ɓɔɠɔ makɛna ɲadedai zu, é ʋilɛ niima vaiti ba, gè ti wosu, toɠa ɠɛ ga lɛbiya aniɲakai, é makɛsu yɛ, é pɛlɛ kɛɛɠɛi maavai ɠɛɛzu, soloogai kɛɛwoti ʋagɔi pɛ ma. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Ɓizɛ nu niinɛlai ma ɠaazuɠulapɔiti ba, è telebodai ɠaiziɛ, ta kidaaleʋei, ta nɛɛbɛi, ta ziilɛigi, wa naati, niiti ti wooɠulazu Maliɠii ma ga ti-yiima ɲadegai. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Ɠɛlɛ ɠimalala maaɠaaliiti ba, un ge la ti ʋa, naati ka ta ɗa kpɔɛi wuzeɠe. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Tama Maliɠii ná-botiɠɛ nui maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa ɠɛ ga kpɔɛleʋe nu. Kɛlɛ kɛni tuʋalaa nɛɛ ɛsɛ pɛ bɛ, é zoo nuiti kalasu, ziilɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Maanɛɛʋɛ é ɗa sakpe nuiti kala ga sɛsɛbogi. Tanisu GALA ka pelei lɛɛ ga tiye, nii a kɛ ti-ziɛ ʋelei maavalibo, ti gaamai ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Ta ʋa ɠima naazu, ti ɠɛ ʋolu ga sɔɓelama nuiti, ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠula Inɛgi ná-balii ɠa, nii é ti zoni, ti lɔ ziimai ɠɛɛ vai zu.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Folo ɠaaɓelagi zu vaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Ɠizɛ nii zu gola, ga yeeɠɛɠalaiti ta ɓaa gola folo ɠaaɓelagiti su. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nuiti ta ɠɛ ga gaazumaavɔɔ nuiti, wali wɔin nuiti, ɓɔɠɔ vaa lɛsu nuiti, gaazumaanɛɛ nuiti, woo ɲɔi wo nuiti, ti zɔlɔɔ nuiti goozotala nuiti. Ta ɠɛ ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛtala nuiti, faa ɲadega la ti ɠaazu ga faa, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>maayotala nuiti, zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ vaa wɔin la ti ma. Ta ɠɛ ɓalaa ga tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo nuiti, ɓɔɠɔzotala nuiti, suɲɔu nuiti. Ta ɠɛ faa ʋagɔi laalɔɠɔma, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>ti ɠɛ ga yaava nuiti, ziiɠula nuiti, ti laavegai ga wasogi, ɓɔɠɔyiimai ɠa nɛɛ ti ʋɛ é leʋe GALA ba. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>GALA gaazuluabai ɠa ɠɛ ti-ɠaazuʋɛti nɔ, kɛlɛ ta ɠɛlɛ ma zɛbɛi ʋa. Maaɠooza naama nuiti ba! <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Tanigaani ta ti zaama, niiti ta ɗa lɔ pɛlɛiti bu, ti ɗa anzanuiti dɔ ta-zobogi wu, niiti zɛbɛ la ti ya, ta ɠi ge la ti ma. Kotoi ɠa anzanui niiti ba, gaazuɠulapɔ ɲɔi ma zii pɛ ge ɠɛ ti zu, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>anzanui naati ta kalagi zɔlɔɔsu yeenɔpɛ, kɛlɛ ti la zooga pɛ ti ʋa gaamai ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Eɠɛʋelei Zanɛseni ta Zamebelɛse ti Moize maaɠaalini la, zenɔ ɠana, zunui niiti ɓalaa ti gaamai maaɠaalizu la. Zunua ʋe ti-ɠigi ɠoloɠologai, ta-ɠidaaleʋei la ga kidaaleʋe ɠiteɠite. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Kɛlɛ ti la lia luɠɔma pɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ɛsɛ pɛ ka suɠwɛɛ ga ta ga ɠimalala nuiti, eɠɛʋelei Zanɛseni ta Zamebelɛse tɔnɔi ɠɛni la.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deve ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun è ʋilɛgɛ pòlu nà-kala bo fai zu, ta tùʋa ʋelei, naa ʋɛɛ kìsu vaiti, ta nà-kidaaleʋei ʋa, ta nà-ziilɔɔi, naa ʋɛɛ nà-nɛɛbɛi ʋa, ta ʋelei gè loni la kpaan, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>wɔinzeɠemai ta kpɔlɔi niiti ti zeiɗai mà. Kpɔlɔi ɓɛgele ɠa gè la ɠɛni sɔlɔɔni Antiyɔse ta Ikoniyume, ta Lisitele? Kpɔlɔi ɓɛgele ɠa gè la ɠɛni suzoni? Kɛlɛ Maliɠii kùlani naati pɛ su. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Tama, zɔi nɔpɛ é pɔ é eteai ziɛ GALA gaazuluabai zu ta-ɠilibalai zu ta Yesu Kilista, naati ta ɗa wɔinzeɠemai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Kɛlɛ faa ɲɔu ɠɛ nuiti ta yaava nuiti ta ɗa li nɔ luɠɔma yeenɔpɛ faa ɲɔi zu, ti ɗa nuiti kaka, ti ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaka tiya ɓɔɠɔi.<verse eid="2TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ɗɔun, lo kpaan naama vaiti su, niiti è ti ɠalani, è yeezeiɗai ti wu ga ladala laazeeliai, mazɔlɔɔ nui é è ɠalaga ga tiye, è naa ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Kaite è-ma loungo ziɛgi zu, è GALA sɛʋɛ ɲadegai ɠwɛɛ. Toɠa zoo é ɠimalai ve è ya, é lo è luɠɔ, è kizogi zɔlɔɔ ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele Yesu Kilista ma. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>GALA Sɛʋɛi pɛ feeʋɛ GALA saalai zu, ná-kulanumai wɔɔlɔʋɛ kalagi wo fai zu, zɛɛi zakpe fai zu, kaka faiti sɔle fai zu, ta telebodai ma ɠalagi wo fai zu, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, GALA nui laazeeli, kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ kɛɛwoti ʋagɔi pɛ kɛɛ vai ma.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ta Yesu Kilista ɠaazu, Kilista nii é ʋaazu nu vuluiti ta gɔvɛiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu, ta tɔun paa vai ta ná-masadai maaʋele ma, nà devei nii veezu è ya, gè maaɓakpa, naama levei ɠa é ga: <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>GALA daawooi laazeeli, daazeeli ga gilimai siɛnɔpɛ su, ma yeeɠɛɠala ɠɛni de, ɓaa ma yeeɠɛɠala mina ɠɛ de, gaalɛɛ ga pagɔ, è zelii lo, è nuiti iɲɔdɔ, è ɗa kalagi wo ga ziilɔɔ laazeeliai pɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ yeeɠɛɠalai ɠa ʋaazu, názu nuiti ti la mɔ wɔinɗa ga ti ʋa woilo gaama ɠalagi ma, kɛlɛ ta ʋilɛ ti ɓɔɠɔyiimaiti nɔ ʋolu, ta kalamɔinti gaalɛ ba, ga nii nɛai ti ʋɛ, naati ti ɗa naa nɔ wo ti ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Ta ɠɛlɛ woilosu gaamai ma, ti ɠaaʋote zɛɛ vaalaali ɓɔɛiti ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Kɛlɛ ɗɔun, ɠɛ ga sɔɓelama nu fai pɛ su, è yiilɔɔ kpɔlɔiti bu, ɗa-lɛnɛbo botii ɠɛ Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli vai zu, ɗa-wotii ɠaaɓela ga pagɔ.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɠigaiziɛ vai ná-saa vai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀un, nà ga ʋa ɠɛɛzu ga puya zalaɠai, dìi yeei zeelia. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Gè kɔɔ ʋagɔi ɠɔa. Gè nà-kpizɛi ɠaaɓelaga. Gè kidaaleʋei makɛgɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Niizu niina, masa bɔɔlɔgi é ga telebo kelei, naa makɛgɛ bɛ̀. Maliɠii, tukpɔɠaaleʋe nui telebogai, naa ɠa é feezu zèa naama volo ná. Nà ɠila taade, kɛlɛ toɠa fe naati pɛ zea, niiti ti ná-kulakɛlɛmai maaɓɔunsu, nɛai ti ʋɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-woo ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Ɠaaɓa, è ʋa pɔ̀ bɛ fala. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Demase ɓeteʋea bà, tɔɔzei eteai nii zu vaiti gola nɛɛʋɛ bɛ, é lia Tesalonike. Kelesɛnse liiʋɛ Galate yooi zu, Tite li Dalamasi yooi zu. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luke ɠila kpe nɔ ɠa é bà ʋɛ. Maleke zeɠe, è ʋaa la ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa zoo é ɓɔ bà nà-botii zu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Gè Tisike leʋegɛ Efɛze. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Ɗa ɠɛna ʋaa, ʋa bɛ̀ ga tookɔba wolai gè zɛni Kaalapuse ʋɔ bɛ, Toloase, ta sɛʋɛ ɓiligiti, ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga kɔlɔ zɛʋɛiti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kɔlɔ zɛʋɛiti</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: ti ɠɛni ga kɔlɔ ɓiligi ti ɓɛtɛai ga baala kɔlɔi ɓaa boli ɠɔlɔi, nii ti ɠɛni sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛzu ma.</char></note><verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Ɠain bo nui Alɛgezandele faa ɲɔi wola ɠɛɛʋɛ ga ze. Maliɠii ɠa sala, é zoloo ná-kɛɛwotiiti ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Ɗa ɓalaagi, dama la, mazɔlɔɔ buzeɠeʋɛ gá-ɓɔɛiti daalɔɠɔma gola.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Kɛ̀ai ma ɓɔɠɔ maalobosu mɔungi tukpɔɠaaleʋezuʋɛ, nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛni loni pòlu, kɛlɛ ti pɛ ti ɠɛlɛni bà. GALA ge mina naa leve ti unma. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Kɛlɛ Maliɠii ɠa é ɓɔni bà, é sɛ̀bɛlɔ, naa ɠa é kɛɛni, gè zooni gè GALA daawooi laazeeli ga pagɔ zii ɠiligiti pɛ ma, gè ɠula zalai la. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Maliɠii ɠa kùla kɛɛwoti ɲɔiti pɛ su. Toɠa kìzo, é dɔ̀ ná-masadai zu geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Lɛbiyai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ! Amina!<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ goo ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Gè Pilisile ta Akilase luʋɔ, ta Wonezifɔle ná-pɛlɛyeɠei. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasete yɛgɛ Kolɛnte, ta gè Tolofime yɛgɛ Milɛ, tɔɔzei é la ɠɛdɛni. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Ɠaaɓa, è ʋa pɔ̀ bɛ aisa samai ʋa zeeli. Ebuluse, ta Pudɛn, ta Linuse, ta Kelodia, ta ade-ɠɛɛloin zɔiti pɛ ta è luʋɔsu.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Maliɠii yɛ è-yɛnvui ʋa. GALA ná-zaalai yɛ wo ʋa. Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
